     "t": "math",
     "tex": "Y = \\sum_{k=0}^{3} m_k(S_1, S_0) \\cdot I_k = \\overline{S_1}\\,\\overline{S_0}I_0 + \\overline{S_1}S_0 I_1 + S_1\\overline{S_0}I_2 + S_1 S_0 I_3"
